{
  "about": "How a client matches DentaQuest's payer-side resources (ids end in -payer) to the provider-side UC07 resources. Match on the BUSINESS KEYS below, never on FHIR ids or on the -payer suffix: a real payer and a real practice never share ids.",
  "patientAppEntry": {
    "about": "How a patient-facing app finds the member at the payer. This is NOT a provider-to-payer match: no provider system holds this ID. The app passes the payer's online member ID and reads the payer-side Patient; everything else is then reached from that Patient.",
